## Step 8 — Load local XALT (every new shell)

**Do not** use plain `module load xalt` on Delta — the system sticky module points at
`/sw/workload/...` and breaks local testing.

  source $PREFIX_DIR/xalt/ncsa_build/load_local_xalt.sh $PREFIX_DIR
  

Verify:

  echo $LD_PRELOAD
