## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---------|--------|-----|
| `LD_PRELOAD` is `/sw/workload/...` | System xalt loaded | `source load_local_xalt.sh` |
| No JSON files | Hostname SKIP in build | Step 2; Step 6 rebuild; grep `.lex` |
| JSON under `target/delta/json` | Stock modulefile | Use customized `build_xalt.sh` + `3.0.2.lua.in` |
| Permission denied on `/sw/workload/.../sitecustomize.py` | Production PYTHONPATH | `load_local_xalt.sh` |
| `libuuid.so` missing | No symlink | Step 7 |
| `ModuleNotFoundError` | No venv | `source venv/bin/activate` |
| Too many `pkg.*` | Step 4 not applied / still old stack filter / not rebuilt | Use AST Step 4 in this file; Step 6 **Rebuild later** |
| `black` extras (`pytokens`, `*__mypyc`, …) | Old stack-based Step 4 | Replace with AST Step 4; rebuild |
| `AttributeError: ... '_orig_compile'` / no `pkg.*` | Used `self._orig_compile` under `__slots__`, or 4c nested in `if (xaltDir)` | Use local `orig_compile`; put 4c outside `if (xaltDir)`; rebuild |

Debug trace:

  export XALT_TRACING=yes
  python3 /tmp/test3.py 2> /tmp/xalt_trace.txt
  grep -i hostname /tmp/xalt_trace.txt

